---
source: crates/nuten_parser/tests/parse.rs
input_file: crates/nuten_parser/test_data/err/redirection/shell_redirection_as_target.nu
---
Root@0..17
  Pipeline@0..16
    PipelineElement@0..16
      Call@0..2
        Word@0..2 "ls"
      Whitespace@2..3 " "
      Redirection@3..5
        Error@3..5
          OutGt@3..5 "o>"
      Whitespace@5..6 " "
      Error@6..8
        Word@6..8 "2>"
      Whitespace@8..9 " "
      Word@9..16 "err.log"
  Newline@16..17 "\n"
error 3..5 "o>": MissingRedirectionTarget
error 6..8 "2>": ShellErrRedirect
